meta {
  name: Download TACOTS feedback
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/tacots/download/tacotsfeedback
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download TACOTS Feedback (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `tacots_feedback` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows from the table (no filters, no pagination) and converts the records to CSV using json2csv, and returns the CSV as raw file bytes with Content-Type: text/csv and Content-Disposition: attachment. The response is not JSON; frontend clients should read it as a Blob and trigger a browser download.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv; charset=utf-8`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="tacots_feedback.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per feedback submission with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID primary key |
  | `studentFirstName` | Student's first name |
  | `studentSurname` | Student's surname |
  | `currentSchool` | Name of school currently attended |
  | `currentClass` | Student's current class level |
  | `scholarshipHelpedStay` | Whether the scholarship helped the student stay in school |
  | `mostHelpfulSupport` | Most helpful type of support received |
  | `studyMotivationRating` | Rating of study motivation |
  | `mentorshipImpactRating` | Rating of mentorship impact |
  | `currentChallenges` | Current challenges faced by the student |
  | `likedMost` | What the student liked most about the programme |
  | `studentImprovementSuggestions` | Student's suggestions for improvement |
  | `parentGuardianName` | Parent/guardian full name |
  | `parentGuardianRelationship` | Parent/guardian relationship to student |
  | `parentPhone` | Parent/guardian phone number |
  | `scholarshipReducedBurden` | Whether the scholarship reduced financial burden |
  | `academicImprovementNoticed` | Whether the parent noticed academic improvement |
  | `attitudeChangeNoticed` | Whether the parent noticed attitude/behavior changes |
  | `parentSatisfactionRating` | Parent's overall satisfaction rating |
  | `programImpactOnFamily` | Parent's assessment of programme impact on the family |
  | `parentImprovementSuggestions` | Parent's suggestions for improvement |
  | `additionalComments` | Any additional comments |
  | `updatedAt` | Last update timestamp |
  | `createdAt` | Creation timestamp |
  | `deletedAt` | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active) |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
